// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 08-adt/inherent_method_mutating_immutable_neg_03.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A mutating-receiver method requires a mutable place. Invoking one on an
// immutable `let` owner local is a genuine mutability error: the body checker
// reports ZOM4024 naming the immutable binding, rather than draining the call
// as a capability rejection or an internal compiler invariant.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4024]: Cannot mutate immutable definition `counter`
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/08-adt/inherent_method_mutating_immutable_neg_03.zom:5:65
